{"law":{"articles":[{"no":"第一條","path":[],"text":"本標準依基隆市建築管理自治條例第二十一條規定訂定之。"},{"no":"第二條","path":[],"text":"基隆市建築工程造價估算標準如附表。"},{"no":"第三條","path":[],"text":"本標準自中華民國一百一十四年一月一日起施行。"}],"attachments":[{"title":"修正總說明.pdf","url":"https://exlaw.klcg.gov.tw/Download.ashx?FileID=13551&id=FL051483&type=LAW"},{"title":"修正對照表.pdf","url":"https://exlaw.klcg.gov.tw/Download.ashx?FileID=13552&id=FL051483&type=LAW"},{"title":"附表修正對照.pdf","url":"https://exlaw.klcg.gov.tw/Download.ashx?FileID=13553&id=FL051483&type=LAW"},{"title":"修正全文及附表.pdf","url":"https://exlaw.klcg.gov.tw/Download.ashx?FileID=13554&id=FL051483&type=LAW"}],"category":"建築與設計","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"","id":"基隆市-FL051483","keywords":[],"kind":"地方規定","modified":"民國 113 年 12 月 20 日","name":"基隆市建築工程造價估算標準","note":"地方資料取自官方頁面；附件保留原站連結。","region":"基隆市","retrieved":"2026-09-29T00:34:00+00:00","snapshot":"","source":"基隆市法規查詢系統","status":"來源現行頁","url":"https://exlaw.klcg.gov.tw/LawContent.aspx?id=FL051483"},"originals":[],"schemaVersion":1}